[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3571990801","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113074#issuecomment-3571990801","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113074","id":3571990801,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7U6EER","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-24T17:42:43Z","updated_at":"2025-11-25T14:58:39Z","body":"> Kind of put ourselves in a corner, but for consistent terminology the method should actually be named `press`. Even in code, no click input is being simulated and, as you implied, `Input.parse_input_event(my_mouse_click)` is absolutely not the same as `click()`. So this name can be quite misleading.\r\n\r\nI deliberately chose the term \"click\" because this method can be used regardless of whether `toggle_mode` is `true` or `false`. I didn't want to evoke unwanted associations with the `pressed` and `toggled` signals (as well as the virtual methods `_pressed()` and `_toggled()`). Also, as far as I know, `click()` is a fairly common case. For example, HTML buttons have this method.\r\n\r\nFinally, the word \"clicked\" is already used in the documentation for this class:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/bbe965432747f49ac647883c871a38ade26bdc4a/doc/classes/BaseButton.xml#L125-L130","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3571990801/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"resolved"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3572240683","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113074#issuecomment-3572240683","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113074","id":3572240683,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7U7BEr","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-24T18:50:42Z","updated_at":"2025-11-24T18:50:42Z","body":"We are going back to the Godot `4.0` times when [`pressed` was being renamed](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/48193) and the bikeshedding that followed. [Something like `activate`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/48193#issuecomment-828595229). Either way I am vehemently against \"click\" because it goes against the engine's own terminology.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3572240683/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3572736560","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113074#issuecomment-3572736560","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113074","id":3572736560,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7U86Iw","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-24T21:09:36Z","updated_at":"2025-11-24T21:09:36Z","body":"I agree that `press` makes more sense here, its not like we have a `click` signal compared to htmls `click` event. It makes sense to associate with the `pressed` and `toggled` signals since this emits them, it calls their virtual methods.\r\nAlso those lines in the docs were added 7+ years ago, `click` generally just refers to the mouse.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3572736560/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5221324963","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113074#issuecomment-5221324963","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113074","id":5221324963,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNzcYow","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-07T19:42:40Z","updated_at":"2026-08-07T19:42:40Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5221324963/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]